#3700
The Entrance To The Shadow Grove~
   Before you lies the Grove of Shadows.  Giant gray trees are all that
can be seen through the thick, coiling shadows, their trunks rising like
the pillars of some vast, dark hall.  A great sense of both power and
menace hangs over the place, and you feel a strong urge to turn and go
back the way you came.  A small path leads north into the shadows, and
back south to the plains.
~
