#3701
The Shadow Grove~
   You are inside the Shadow Grove.  Giant gray trees loom on every
side, and they seem to glare at you through the shifting, shadowy mist
that hides almost everything from view.  The air is cold and clammy, and
strange sounds of moaning and growling come from every direction at
once.  Every way you turn leads only deeper into the shadows, and you
are very confused.
