#3712
The Entrance To The High Tower~
   You have reached the entrance to the High Tower of Sorcery.  The
tower looms above you to an incredible height, its pale walls vanishing
into the storm clouds above, where lightning flickers silently.  A gate
of glittering diamond stands to the north, catching what little light
there is and scattering it into tiny rainbows.  Behind you to the south,
the trail back into the grove has already vanished in the mist.
~
