#3713
Inside The High Tower Of Sorcery~
   You are inside the High Tower of Sorcery, and the sight is truly
amazing: somehow, the tower is much larger inside than it is outside.
The ceiling soars far overhead, lost among drifting motes of light, and
the floor is a mosaic of stars and planets that seem to turn slowly
beneath your feet.  The common room lies to the north, the dining room
to the west and a plain hallway to the east.  The diamond gate leads
back south.
~
