an unknown metal of the brightest white, almost blindingly stark.  A
flickering flame burns in the center of the room, seeming to feed upon
darkness and cleanse the room of any evil, and you feel a slight tug at
your being as the flame leans toward you.  Doorways lead north, south
and west, and the antechamber lies to the east.
