The Quiet Room~
   You stand in a small, round reading room lined from floor to ceiling
with shelves of books.  Not a sound reaches you here; even your
footsteps make no noise on the thick carpet, and when you breathe you
hear nothing at all.  A reading desk stands beneath a soft globe of
light, with a great book lying open upon it.  A door to the east leads
back into the classroom.
